diff -ruN orig/debian/changelog new/debian/changelog
--- a/debian/changelog	2025-05-03 10:16:14.000000000 -0700
+++ b/debian/changelog	2026-11-04 15:05:28.739376625 -0800
@@ -1,3 +1,16 @@
+isc-dhcp (4.4.3-P1-8+supermox1) unstable; urgency=medium
+
+  * Drop the dhclient hooks Debian ships for systemd-resolved (debian/resolved
+    and debian/resolved-enter): they shell out to the service manager to hand
+    the lease to systemd-resolved, which is not present here. isc-dhcp-client.install
+    no longer installs them, so dhclient's enter/exit hook directories
+    stay clean and dhclient works unmodified under sysvinit.
+  * Add an empty override_dh_installsystemd so debhelper neither installs nor
+    enables any unit: the client packages ship no service files, and this keeps
+    that true if upstream ever adds one.
+
+ -- SuperMox <noreply@supermox.me>  Wed, 04 Nov 2026 17:07:40 -0800
+
 isc-dhcp (4.4.3-P1-8) unstable; urgency=medium
 
   * Rename /etc/apparmor.d/local/sbin.dhclient conffile (Closes: #1103503)
